From 82a7a4fa890673c042dbfcd7e767cfc03fe9bff0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 06:36:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/59] Ingestion review fixes: copies never add roots, undated
 evidence never dates a claim, no input text in rejections

F1 a forward/share link never replaces a record's content root; the origin's object key is exported
so compute_support merges forwards with their original (reviewer probes S1-S5 now 1 root / unknown).
F2 coordinator freshness ignores the observed time of undated refs (meta.time_inferred); local_export
no longer dates content by exported_at or neighbouring records. F3 only ConnectorError codes reach
the rejection ledger; reasons capped. F4 pipeline-level atomicity tests. Engineer: ENGINEER-D
(claude-sonnet-5-5); full suite on the shared tree 479 passed, 7 skipped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QgQYqiZ8KjrbuXgxGadraA
